{"seq":2,"slug":"stage-migration","title":"生命周期阶段迁移监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/lifecycle-stage/stage-migration","wordCount":2755,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"生命周期阶段迁移监控\">生命周期阶段迁移监控</h1><p>把客户分成五个阶段之后，一份「本期各阶段人数分布」的报表其实说明不了什么——人数分布的变化可以被新客涌入稀释，可以被季节性整体抬升，也可以被一次阈值调整凭空制造出来。真正有信息量的是<strong>迁移</strong>：谁从哪个阶段移动到了哪个阶段，移动的比例是多少，以及这个比例相对历史基线是否异常。迁移监控是这套体系从「描述性看板」升级为「诊断性系统」的那一步，也是它第一次能主动报警而不是等人来问。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-迁移矩阵比人数分布多出的信息\">核心概念：迁移矩阵比人数分布多出的信息</h2><p>设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 期各阶段人数向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_t \\in \\mathbb{R}^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，阶段之间的迁移矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t[a][b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 表示从上期处于阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 转移到本期处于阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的人数。三者满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>新增</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{t} = n_{t-1} \\cdot M_t + \\text{新增}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6528em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新增</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>人数分布只知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而迁移矩阵知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的每一格。这个差别在诊断上等于「只知道体温」和「知道是哪个器官在发炎」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 上期&#10;    N1[新客]&#10;    G1[成长]&#10;    M1[成熟]&#10;    D1[衰退]&#10;    C1[流失]&#10;  end&#10;  N1 --&gt;|复购| G2[成长]&#10;  N1 --&gt;|沉默| D2[衰退]&#10;  G1 --&gt;|达标| M2[成熟]&#10;  G1 --&gt;|间隔超限| D2&#10;  M2 --&gt;|间隔超限| D2&#10;  D2 --&gt;|超窗口| C2[流失]&#10;  D2 --&gt;|回购| G2&#10;  C2 --&gt;|回购| G2&#10;  M1 --&gt;|间隔超限| D2&#10;  D1 --&gt;|超窗口| C2\">graph TD\n  subgraph 上期\n    N1[新客]\n    G1[成长]\n    M1[成熟]\n    D1[衰退]\n    C1[流失]\n  end\n  N1 --&gt;|复购| G2[成长]\n  N1 --&gt;|沉默| D2[衰退]\n  G1 --&gt;|达标| M2[成熟]\n  G1 --&gt;|间隔超限| D2\n  M2 --&gt;|间隔超限| D2\n  D2 --&gt;|超窗口| C2[流失]\n  D2 --&gt;|回购| G2\n  C2 --&gt;|回购| G2\n  M1 --&gt;|间隔超限| D2\n  D1 --&gt;|超窗口| C2</pre><p>上图的箭头集合就是生命周期状态机允许的全部迁移路径（各阶段的判定口径见 <a href=\"stage-definition\">新客/成长/成熟/衰退/流失划分</a>），任何不在这张图里的迁移（比如新客直接到成熟）都是不允许的，若监控中出现就说明判定逻辑有 bug——这是迁移矩阵的第一个用途：<strong>一致性校验</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移矩阵的构造口径\">迁移矩阵的构造口径</h2><p>构造迁移矩阵看似只是两次快照做 join，但有几个口径问题不解决，出来的数字会自相矛盾。</p>\n<p><strong>问题一：观察窗口的长度。</strong> 日粒度的迁移矩阵噪声极大（周末、时区导致的人数波动远超真实迁移），而季度粒度又太钝（一次产品故障引起的回流会在季度末被平均掉）。推荐<strong>日粒度计算、周粒度告警</strong>：每日生成矩阵用于事后归因，告警与趋势判定基于 7 日滚动聚合。</p>\n<p><strong>问题二：新客与「新到平台」不等于「新到该阶段」。</strong> 上一期不存在的客户（首次下单）不能计为「从某个阶段迁移过来」，他们是新增流入，应当单列。把新增算成从「新客」自环会稀释所有迁移率。</p>\n<p><strong>问题三：跨期客户必须重算而不是继承。</strong> 如果一个客户在本期因为数据延迟补录了三笔订单，他上期的阶段判定也会变。此时应当以「用同一份数据重算上期」为准，而不是保留历史快照里的旧判定。实践中做法是：<strong>快照存判定结果供监控对比，但一旦发现数据补录（订单创建时间早于快照日期），就把受影响客户打标记并从迁移率分母中剔除</strong>，避免把数据问题误报成业务问题。</p>\n<p><strong>问题四：迁移率的分母。</strong> 每一格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t[a][b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 应当除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{t-1}[a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（上期处于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的人数），得到「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 阶段的客户本期有百分之多少迁移到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>」。这样得到的矩阵每一行和为 1（除新增流入外），行与行之间可以直接比较，而人数越多的阶段自然有更稳的估计。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>rate</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rate}_t[a \\to b] = \\frac{M_t[a][b]}{n_{t-1}[a]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"四种迁移的解读\">四种迁移的解读</h2><p>迁移矩阵里方向不同，业务含义完全不同，告警策略也应不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>业务含义</th>\n<th>告警级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正向迁移</td>\n<td>新客 → 成长、成长 → 成熟</td>\n<td>运营在起作用，客户在深化</td>\n<td>无需告警，但比例下降要关注（可能策略失效）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停滞迁移</td>\n<td>新客 → 新客（长期停留）</td>\n<td>首单转化了但没有形成习惯</td>\n<td>中：新客池子会越积越大直到某天集中流失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆向迁移</td>\n<td>成熟 → 成长、成长 → 衰退</td>\n<td>已建立的客户关系在退化</td>\n<td>高：这是最早也最可靠的预警信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>彻底流失</td>\n<td>衰退 → 流失</td>\n<td>关系终止</td>\n<td>取决于量级，通常滞后于逆向迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>逆向迁移的价值被严重低估。</strong> 从成熟退回成长的客户，其购买间隔已经超出自己的历史基线，但还没有超出流失窗口——此时他仍然活跃、仍然可能被挽回，而挽回成本远低于流失后的重激活成本。反馈链路是这样的：成熟 → 成长的比例上升，通常在 30–60 天后体现为衰退 → 流失的比例上升。因此<strong>监控成熟 → 成长这一步，等于提前一到两个季度获得流失预警</strong>。</p>\n<p>这也意味着告警不能只看「流失率」——流失率是一个滞后指标，等它上升时你已经损失了一个季度的挽回窗口。真正该盯的是逆向迁移率。这与 AI 留存与复购增长系统里的流失预测是互补关系：迁移监控看的是<strong>群体流动的结构性变化</strong>（哪个环节在漏水），流失预测看的是<strong>个体是否将流失</strong>（该给谁发消息）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常检测-如何判断迁移率-不正常\">异常检测：如何判断迁移率「不正常」</h2><p>迁移率本身会波动（节假日、促销、竞品动作），因此需要一个基线才能判断异常。三种做法从简到繁。</p>\n<p><strong>做法一：同比对比。</strong> 与去年同期同周对比，天然规避季节性。缺点是跨境业务往往按季度新增市场，去年同期可能没有对应市场的数据。</p>\n<p><strong>做法二：滚动基线 + 控制带。</strong> 用过去 8–12 周同周几的迁移率计算均值与标准差，超出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 2\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 触发告警。简单有效，但对趋势性变化（连续 5 周缓慢抬升但每周都在带内）不敏感。</p>\n<p><strong>做法三：结构与量级分离。</strong> 把迁移率的变化分解为两部分：<strong>结构变化</strong>（各市场占比变化导致的整体迁移率变化）与<strong>同市场内部变化</strong>（同一市场里迁移率真的变了）。前者通常无害（新市场加入会拉低平均值），后者才是需要调查的。分解方式是按市场分别计算迁移率，再用固定权重（如上期市场结构）重新聚合，得到「如果市场结构没变，迁移率会是多少」的反事实值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>rate</mtext><mi>t</mi><mtext>fixed-structure</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mtext>rate</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rate}^{\\text{fixed-structure}}_t[a \\to b] = \\sum_{m} w_{m,t-1} \\cdot \\text{rate}^{m}_t[a \\to b], \\qquad w_{m,t-1} = \\frac{n_{t-1}[a, m]}{n_{t-1}[a]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed-structure</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个反事实值与实际值的差就是纯粹的结构效应。<strong>推荐做法三作为主口径</strong>，前两种作为快速筛查——因为跨境业务的常态就是市场结构在持续变化，不做分解的告警会被新市场加入反复误报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从迁移率到干预决策\">从迁移率到干预决策</h2><p>迁移监控的输出不应该是「告警」就结束，而应当直接指向可干预的环节。做法是为每一种异常迁移匹配它的可能原因与对应的干预方向。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测到的异常</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>干预方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新客 → 成长 比例下降</td>\n<td>首单体验差、履约变慢、首单商品与预期不符</td>\n<td>首单后 N 天的触达与补贴（见第三章第 1 篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成长 → 成熟 比例下降</td>\n<td>缺乏提频抓手、缺少跨品类推荐</td>\n<td>交叉销售与品类扩展（见第三章第 2 篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟 → 成长 比例上升</td>\n<td>竞争分流、价格变化、权益缩水</td>\n<td>价值客户关怀与权益复核（见第四章第 2 篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰退 → 流失 比例上升且新客 → 衰退 同时上升</td>\n<td>获客质量问题：买来的人群结构变差</td>\n<td>溯回获客渠道，检查出价与人群定向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流失 → 成长 比例上升</td>\n<td>挽回策略生效</td>\n<td>保留并放大，同时核算增量 ROI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得强调：<strong>迁移监控同样能验证挽回策略是否真的有效</strong>。如果第三章的挽回动作上线后，流失 → 成长 的比例没有变化，那说明动作没有产生增量（或者触达根本没送达），这与增量实验的结论应当互相印证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-迁移矩阵的存储与查询\">工程实现：迁移矩阵的存储与查询</h2><p>迁移矩阵规模很小（5×5×市场数×日期），最自然的存储是一张按 (date, market, from_stage, to_stage) 四元组组织的计数表，配一张按 (date, market) 的基线表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MigrationCell {&#10;  snapshotDate: string;&#10;  market: string;&#10;  fromStage: Stage;&#10;  toStage: Stage | &#39;new_inflow&#39;;&#10;  count: number;&#10;  fromStageTotal: number;&#10;  rate: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MigrationAlert {&#10;  snapshotDate: string;&#10;  fromStage: Stage;&#10;  toStage: Stage;&#10;  observedRate: number;&#10;  expectedRate: number;&#10;  fixedStructureRate: number;&#10;  structuralEffect: number;&#10;  sigma: number;&#10;  severity: &#39;info&#39; | &#39;warn&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  primaryMarkets: string[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationCell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  snapshotDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  market</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fromStage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  toStage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'new_inflow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fromStageTotal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationAlert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  snapshotDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fromStage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  toStage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  observedRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expectedRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fixedStructureRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  structuralEffect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sigma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'info'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  primaryMarkets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个实现要点。第一，<strong>每日全量重算并落快照</strong>，而不是增量更新——阶段判定是纯函数（见 <a href=\"stage-definition\">新客/成长/成熟/衰退/流失划分</a> 的工程实现一节），全量重算的成本远低于维护增量一致性的复杂度。第二，<strong>同时存 <code>rate</code> 与 <code>fromStageTotal</code></strong>，因为只有 rate 无法回溯人数口径，只有人数无法比较不同规模的阶段。第三，<strong>告警必须带 <code>primaryMarkets</code></strong>：一个全局迁移率异常，往往只由一两个市场驱动，不指出是哪些市场，调查会从全平台开始，代价高十倍。</p>\n<p>关于调度频率：日粒度计算、周粒度告警、月粒度复盘。复盘时把当月的异常迁移事件与当月的运营动作、产品发布、竞争事件做时间对齐，形成一份「迁移事件簿」——这份簿子在半年后就是最有价值的诊断资产，因为它是唯一记录了「什么动作导致了什么结构性变化」的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>迁移矩阵比人数分布多出的信息是「谁在往哪走」，它既能做一致性校验（不合法迁移 = 判定逻辑 bug），也能做早期预警。</li>\n<li>构造口径有四条：日粒度计算周粒度告警、新增流入单列、数据补录打标记剔除、迁移率分母用上期该阶段人数。</li>\n<li>逆向迁移（成熟 → 成长、成长 → 衰退）是最有价值的告警对象，它比流失率提前一到两个季度反映关系退化；只盯流失率等于放弃了整个挽回窗口。</li>\n<li>异常检测推荐「结构分离」口径：把迁移率变化分解为市场结构效应与同市场内部效应，用上期权重构造反事实值；跨境业务市场结构持续变化，不分离会反复误报。</li>\n<li>迁移异常应当直接映射到干预方向与责任章节，而不是止于告警；流失 → 成长 的比例也是验证挽回策略增量效果的独立证据。</li>\n<li>存储上每日全量重算落快照，同时保留 rate 与分母人数，告警必须指出主要由哪些市场驱动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生命周期阶段迁移监控","id":"生命周期阶段迁移监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：迁移矩阵比人数分布多出的信息","id":"核心概念-迁移矩阵比人数分布多出的信息"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移矩阵的构造口径","id":"迁移矩阵的构造口径"},{"level":2,"text":"四种迁移的解读","id":"四种迁移的解读"},{"level":2,"text":"异常检测：如何判断迁移率「不正常」","id":"异常检测-如何判断迁移率-不正常"},{"level":2,"text":"从迁移率到干预决策","id":"从迁移率到干预决策"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：迁移矩阵的存储与查询","id":"工程实现-迁移矩阵的存储与查询"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新客/成长/成熟/衰退/流失划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/lifecycle-stage/stage-definition"},"next":{"title":"RFM 与生命周期分群结合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/lifecycle-stage/rfm-lifecycle-segment"}}